{"version":1,"content":"<p>馮德倫旗下藝人譚旻萱，爆出跟網球好手黃澤林熱戀，被熱討是現任男友與其前度陳康堤的第三者，他坦言：「這個情况好難答，首先我不太了解件事，而且兩個女主角，一邊是我好朋友（陳奕迅）個女，一邊是我公司藝人。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:21:16.019651+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:59:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:18:20.235465+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:18:19.990644+00:00","content_hash":"f9d13ee8c3ff630aa8573f6ec3af9c3dbe2cabae41bb0801c4ad3c24b4c77ba7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}